    notes: >-
      The versioned-rulings, drift-gate and isolation-seam discipline this project is built
      on, and the origin of src/nonius/stats.py. Concept DOI, which resolves to the latest
      version. See NOTICE.
  - type: software
    title: >-
      Spaghetti Architect: A Contamination-Resistant, By-Construction-Labelled,
      Multi-Language Code Dataset Generator
    authors:
      - family-names: Ji
        given-names: Yuxiang
        orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-9835-3800"
        affiliation: "Sunway College"
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21033174
